          "A change in systems, policy, client mix, or volume can make the result stale. Record those triggers with the finding. If the definition changes, keep the old and new rules side by side for the transition period. Label which rule applies to each case so the comparison remains honest. The source record stays in the approved system with restricted access. The next reviewer should be able to repeat the check from the written definition."
