          "Report what moved, what did not, and what remains unknown. That final sentence is the honest close of a measurement protocol. It is more useful than a precise-looking rate built on an unclear denominator. The goal is a reviewable decision, not a perfect number. The source record stays in the approved system with restricted access. The next reviewer should be able to repeat the check from the written definition."
